  "title": "Ex 5.20 · a ≡ 1 (mod 5) gives a² ≡ 1 (mod 5)",
  "prompt": "Let $a$ be an integer with $a \\equiv 1 \\pmod 5$. Prove that $a^2 \\equiv 1 \\pmod 5$.",
  "answer_format": "A structured proof: let, case, expr and witness steps (notes optional). No final answer box.",
